  "description": "2000 LBS Heavy Duty Platform Truck Push Cart Dolly, Foldable Large Flatbed Cart with 6\" Swivel Wheels, Steel Platform Dolly Moving Cart Hand Truck for Groceries, Garage (36\" x 24\")\nFeatures\n2000 LBS Weight Capacity: This heavy duty platform truck is built for tough jobs; Its steel frame and 6\" rubber-armored wheels conquer 2000 lbs loads—hauls machinery, pallets, or materials easily; The diamond-tread surface ensures zero slippage\n360° Swivel Wheels: Smooth passage of this hand truck in tight corners with 2 swivel wheels and 2 rigid casters; 2 lockable rear wheels offer stability on any terrain; Rubber treads roll silently over concrete, gravel, or grass with no piercing squeaks\nFoldable Flatbed Cart: Effortlessly fold or unfold in one second with its collapsible handle and compact design; When folded, the moving cart shrinks to 1/4 of its size, making it easy to store in closets, garages, or trucks without sacrificing durability\nMulti-Scenario Push Cart Dolly: Your universal muscle to haul refrigerators up stairs, engine blocks across garages, or feed sacks on farms; This steel platform dolly, with powder-coated armor, laughs at rust, scratches, and other elements\nExtra-Wide Platform: Get big and go bold with this flat moving cart; Its wide 36’’x24’’ platform fits oversized boxes, lumber, or equipment; The textured steel securely holds stacks, while low-profile design lets you slide heavy items without back strain",
